OpenCPN 5.14.2 for AmigaOS 3: where it finds its data and keeps its settings.
- base_platform.cpp: shared data is data/ in the program's drawer (it was
  /usr/local/share/OpenCPN/, so no styles were found and it could not start);
  settings, routes, tracks and the log go in User/ in the drawer, made at the
  first start (they were in ENVARC:.OpenCPN, which is copied to RAM at boot).
- ocpn_app.cpp: wx has no id for AmigaOS, and asking for its name failed two
  debug checks at start; the log line says "AmigaOS".

